<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Grootvlei posts Sept qtr net loss.</title>
<headline>Grootvlei posts Sept qtr net loss.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-September versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss before capital spending     4.09 vs 4.79 profit</p>
<p>    Capital spending			   6.60 vs 3.89</p>
<p>Tonnes milled</p>
<p>	- Underground		     120,000   vs 115,000</p>
<p>Gold output (kg)</p>
<p>	- Underground			   510   vs   601</p>
<p>Yield (gram/t)</p>
<p>	- Underground			   4.25  vs 5.23</p>
<p>Cost (rand/kg)</p>
<p>	- Underground			 62,541  vs 46,551</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     55,127  vs 53,062</p>
<p>Full name: The Grootvlei Proprietary Mines Ltd, managed by Randgold and Exploration Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said gold production decreased by 91 kg as a result of inconsistent grade recoveries.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
